{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"coverage\":[{\"reason\":\"Used to define the actor, promotional setting, gift rule, product-type linkage, discount exception, and qualified treatment of returns.\",\"status\":\"INTERPRETED\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u0.2\"},{\"reason\":\"Provides the principal exception-attachment language and product-type scope.\",\"status\":\"INTERPRETED\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u12.2646\"},{\"reason\":\"States the paragraph 3.11 gift prohibition and fee/charge discount exception.\",\"status\":\"INTERPRETED\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u13.2987\"},{\"reason\":\"Provides the conditional prohibition concerning additional returns and incentives.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u14.3675\"},{\"reason\":\"Describes fund-return/top-up components and possible structured-product treatment; relevant qualifications remain separate.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u7.1360\"},{\"reason\":\"States the separate section 103 public-invitation offence and its stated exceptions.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u8.1651\"},{\"reason\":\"States the section 103 offence and authorisation/exemption qualifications.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u9.1940\"},{\"reason\":\"Explains possible misleading attribution of distributor guarantees.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u10.2239\"},{\"reason\":\"Provides advertising and service-marketing controls that may apply to accompanying representations.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"},{\"reason\":\"Provides advertising-return presentation principles.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"},{\"reason\":\"Provides restrictions on misleading deposit-like representations.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"reason\":\"Identifies the Code of Conduct.\",\"status\":\"CONTEXT\",\"unit_id\":\"db4